docs {
  ## Method, Endpoint, and Auth
  
  `PATCH /api/v1/groups/:groupID/cover` — Group owner or site admin; Bearer access token required.
  
  ## Description
  
  Updates the group's cover image by linking an existing valid attachment of type `GROUP_COVER`.
  
  ## Request
  
  ### Path Parameters
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `groupID` | `integer` | Yes | Positive group ID. |
  
  ### Headers
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | `Bearer <access-token>` |
  | `Content-Type` | `string` | Yes | `application/json` |
  
  ### Body
  
  ```json
  {
    "cover_attachment_id": 1
  }
  ```
  
  ## Response
  
  Returns the updated group details (`dto.GroupResponse`) with HTTP 200.
}
